# q64music.map - Ocarina of Time soundfont instruments to Quest 64 programs.
# Lines: <font> <instrument> <program>  (numbers hex with 0x or decimal; # comments)
# Instrument numbers are the sequence's (0-based); the names are from
# LuigiXHero's OoT instrument list (1-based there). A first guess by
# instrument type, to be tuned by ear: Quest 64's bank has no names, but
# its envelopes say which programs sustain and which decay:
#   sustain (strings, winds, pads, organ): 0 1 2 3 4 5 6 10 11 15 19 20 21 22 23 28
#   decay (piano, harp, plucks, mallets):  7 8 12 13 14 16 17 18 25 27
#   bass (multi-sampled low keys): 26     drum kit (GM keys): 9     one-shot hit: 24
# Programs the game's music uses: field theme 4 5 0 6 7 9; battle 21 0 18 25 23 19 7 9.


